================================================================================

salesforce/ja3  — https://github.com/salesforce/ja3
    Produces JA3 / JA3S fingerprints on ssl.log and JA3 Intel entries.
    License: BSD 3-Clause. Copyright (c) Salesforce.com, Inc.

netsoldier-ja4.zeek — first-party (deploy/docker/zeek/scripts/)
    Produces JA4 TLS client fingerprints on ssl.log. A clean-room
    implementation written from the published JA4 specification, which
    FoxIO, LLC releases under BSD 3-Clause; it contains no FoxIO code.
    "JA4" is a trademark of FoxIO, LLC — the name is used solely to
    identify the fingerprint format. The FoxIO-licensed, patent-pending
    JA4+ methods (JA4S, JA4H, JA4X, JA4L, JA4SSH, JA4T, ...) are NOT
    implemented, so no FoxIO License 1.1 obligations — including its
    restriction on monetization — apply to netSoldier.

The JA3 package runs inside the BSD-licensed Zeek process; the GPL-3.0
Go services consume only the resulting log records via ClickHouse. See
docs/adr/0003-first-party-ja4.md for the licensing analysis.
